  "title": "Nordic Regional NWP Models",
  "description": "A cloud-native Icechunk/Zarr archive of hourly atmospheric analysis and forecast fields covering the Nordic region and Arctic, combining the Danish HARMONIE model (2 km resolution, Greenland and Iceland) with the MetCoOp MEPS model (2.5 km resolution, broader Nordic region). Hourly analysis fields are approximated using the first three forecast steps of each model run.",
